    @Test syntheticBusinessCall() throws Exception {
        // create quadrat → 201
        // register transplant → 201, transplantedAt == fixed instant
        // replay same body → 200
        // same requestId different plant → 409
        // review ALIVE → 200
        // validation: missing requestId → 422
        // seal → 200 with counts
        // GET quadrat → counts and seal
    }
}
```

